WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.075
This is Miss Sydeon.

00:00:01.075 --> 00:00:02.190
Sydeon.
[MUSIC]

00:00:02.190 --> 00:00:03.550
Hello, nice to meet you guys.

00:00:03.550 --> 00:00:04.350
Hi, hi.

00:00:04.350 --> 00:00:05.150
Hello to Marvel.

00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:07.440
[LAUGHING] We were just
talking about the fact

00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:10.050
that this is your very
first film premiere.

00:00:10.050 --> 00:00:11.260
What's it like to be here?

00:00:11.260 --> 00:00:12.460
Oh my gosh, it's amazing.

00:00:12.460 --> 00:00:15.060
I never thought that playing
video games was going to get me

00:00:15.060 --> 00:00:17.730
on the purple carpet here
interviewing with you guys

00:00:17.730 --> 00:00:20.280
and hanging out with Marvel,
but what a journey it's been.

00:00:20.280 --> 00:00:21.880
I'm glad to be here.

00:00:21.880 --> 00:00:23.190
So let me ask you this.

00:00:23.190 --> 00:00:24.810
Because even though
it's your first carpet,

00:00:24.810 --> 00:00:26.500
you did not come to play.

00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:27.300
Thank you.

00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:29.430
Tell us about this outfit,
because you look amazing.

00:00:29.430 --> 00:00:30.910
Head to toe, I love everything.

00:00:30.910 --> 00:00:31.710
Thank you.

00:00:31.710 --> 00:00:32.850
Well, I'm dressed today.

00:00:32.850 --> 00:00:34.470
I got everything from StockX.

00:00:34.470 --> 00:00:37.860
So I have my Chanel earrings,
I have my off white dress,

00:00:37.860 --> 00:00:40.380
I have my Amina Muaddi shoes.

00:00:40.380 --> 00:00:42.180
And then I have my
Brandon Blackwood

00:00:42.180 --> 00:00:44.080
end systemic racism bag here.

00:00:44.080 --> 00:00:45.777
This purple little
number, I love it.

00:00:45.777 --> 00:00:47.610
Can we get like a little
highlight on that bag really

00:00:47.610 --> 00:00:48.410
quickly?

00:00:48.410 --> 00:00:49.710
The color matches so well.

00:00:49.710 --> 00:00:51.120
It's beautiful.
I love the way.

00:00:51.120 --> 00:00:52.080
It matches my dress.

00:00:52.080 --> 00:00:54.060
I am like super, super
happy with the way

00:00:54.060 --> 00:00:54.930
I'm dressed tonight.

00:00:54.930 --> 00:00:57.060
Well, we know you're a
great StockX ambassador.

00:00:57.060 --> 00:00:58.410
Obviously, head to toe.

00:00:58.410 --> 00:01:00.810
Can you tell us a little bit
about your love of Marvel,

00:01:00.810 --> 00:01:03.390
the Marvel fandom, how that's
always integrated for you

00:01:03.390 --> 00:01:04.480
into video games as well?

00:01:04.480 --> 00:01:05.280
Yeah, absolutely.

00:01:05.280 --> 00:01:07.080
So I was just
explaining earlier,

00:01:07.080 --> 00:01:08.970
like I grew up with
bedtime stories,

00:01:08.970 --> 00:01:10.200
but it was comic books.

00:01:10.200 --> 00:01:12.720
So my dad is like the
biggest Marvel fan,

00:01:12.720 --> 00:01:16.110
and that was what I was
learning about when I was a kid

00:01:16.110 --> 00:01:17.190
and what I was reading.

00:01:17.190 --> 00:01:20.250
So it just transcended
into this like thing.

00:01:20.250 --> 00:01:22.140
I started gaming,
reading comics more,

00:01:22.140 --> 00:01:24.480
talking about comics
on stream, and now

00:01:24.480 --> 00:01:26.350
I'm at a Marvel premiere.

00:01:26.350 --> 00:01:27.150
It happens like that.

00:01:27.150 --> 00:01:27.960
Yeah, wow.

00:01:27.960 --> 00:01:30.900
And you know what does it mean
for you to be at this Marvel

00:01:30.900 --> 00:01:32.250
premiere in particular?

00:01:32.250 --> 00:01:33.210
What does that mean to you?

00:01:33.210 --> 00:01:34.710
Oh gosh, it means everything.

00:01:34.710 --> 00:01:38.820
Like I think that feeling like
I'm a piece of representation

00:01:38.820 --> 00:01:41.280
in gaming for like younger
Black women, younger

00:01:41.280 --> 00:01:43.170
just Black kids
in general, to be

00:01:43.170 --> 00:01:45.270
able to be here and
see representation

00:01:45.270 --> 00:01:47.700
on the big screen and be
able to celebrate that is

00:01:47.700 --> 00:01:48.960
the absolute best feeling.

00:01:48.960 --> 00:01:50.370
For my first
premiere, I wouldn't

00:01:50.370 --> 00:01:51.510
have wanted it any other way.

00:01:51.510 --> 00:01:52.480
Absolutely.
I love that.

00:01:52.480 --> 00:01:53.280
So exciting.

00:01:53.280 --> 00:01:55.860
Well, as our final question,
we have to ask, is there anyone

00:01:55.860 --> 00:01:57.300
you're insanely
excited to see tonight?

00:01:57.300 --> 00:01:59.680
Anything you're insanely
excited to see tonight?

00:01:59.680 --> 00:02:01.830
I have to go with just
the movie in general.

00:02:01.830 --> 00:02:03.270
Like I'm so, so excited.

00:02:03.270 --> 00:02:06.480
Like every time I've watched
the trailer for Black Panther,

00:02:06.480 --> 00:02:07.290
I've gotten chills.

00:02:07.290 --> 00:02:08.460
Like just absolute tears.

00:02:08.460 --> 00:02:10.780
I know it's going to be a moving
one, and I'm very excited.

00:02:10.780 --> 00:02:11.580
Absolutely.

00:02:11.580 --> 00:02:13.110
Get in there then.

00:02:13.110 --> 00:02:15.240
We'll see you inside.

00:02:15.240 --> 00:02:16.790
- It's great to meet you, Syd.
- Nice to meet you.

00:02:16.790 --> 00:02:17.590
Thank you.

00:02:17.590 --> 00:02:19.250
Lovely to-- meet you.

